  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut the sweet potato (unpeeled) into bite-sized chunks. Cut the cauliflower into small florets.\n• Place the sweet potato, cauliflower and All\u0002American spice blend on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333050d071375cbf7e2b87/step-1973b3a7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, slice the kernels off the corn cob. Grate the carrot (unpeeled). Roughly chop the coriander. Finely zest the lime to get a generous pinch, then slice into wedges. In a small bowl, combine the lime zest and 1/2 the sour cream. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333050d071375cbf7e2b87/step-5e3c8e04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Add the corn kernels and cook until lightly charred, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl and set aside.\n• TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333050d071375cbf7e2b87/step-bd594911.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPICY! The chipotle sauce is spicy, add less if you are sensitive to heat. In a medium bowl, combine the shredded cabbage mix, carrot, remaining sour cream, mild chipotle sauce and a pinch of salt. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333050d071375cbf7e2b87/step-fe8237b9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the coriander, a generous squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil to the charred corn.\n• Season and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333050d071375cbf7e2b87/step-d741d074.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the spiced cauliflower and sweet potato between bowls. Serve with the slaw and the charred corn salsa. Top with the lime cream. Serve with the remaining lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60333050d071375cbf7e2b87/step-9d4969d7.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
